{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Ceuqu7FRxZcFhdcfssdfi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. The command executed successfully with:\n- **Command**: `./mvnw test`\n- **Result**: BUILD SUCCESS\n- **Tests run**: 17 total\n  - ShipmentControllerTest: 9 tests (5 existing + 4 new)\n  - OrderControllerTest: 4 tests (all passing)\n  - SampleServiceApplicationTests: 1 test (passing)\n  - CustomerControllerTest: 3 tests (all passing)\n- **Failures**: 0\n- **Errors**: 0\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance Criteria Mapping**\n\n1. **Existing build passes** ✓ — Maven build completed successfully with no errors\n2. **Existing tests pass** ✓ — All 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests pass; OrderControllerTest, CustomerControllerTest, and SampleServiceApplicationTests all pass unchanged\n3. **POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm confirms a created shipment and persists it** ✓ — Test \"confirms a created shipment and transitions to CONFIRMED status\" verifies status change from CREATED to CONFIRMED and persistence\n4. **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API** ✓ — Uses ConflictException (409) and ResourceNotFoundException (404) with ErrorCode enum values, consistent with create endpoint pattern\n5. **A repeated confirm succeeds; a cancelled shipment is refused; an unknown id is refused** ✓ — Three separate tests cover: idempotent success on CONFIRMED, 409 with SHIPMENT_ALREADY_CANCELLED on CANCELLED, 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND on missing\n6. **No new Maven dependency appears** ✓ — No pom.xml changes made; used existing Spring Boot, Kotlin, JUnit libraries\n7. **No unrelated production file changes** ✓ — Only modified ShipmentController.kt (added endpoint) and ApiError.kt (added error code); no changes to other modules\n\n**Diff Review**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Added `SHIPMENT_ALREADY_CANCELLED` to ErrorCode enum. This is required for the new 409 error case when confirming a cancelled shipment.\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added `confirm()` endpoint with:\n   - PathVariable for shipmentId\n   - Proper error handling: ResourceNotFoundException for missing shipment, ConflictException for cancelled\n   - Idempotent behavior: CONFIRMED shipments return 200 OK unchanged\n   - State transition: CREATED → CONFIRMED with persistence via repository.save()\n   - Consistent use of existing error handling infrastructure\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added four test methods:\n   - `confirms a created shipment and transitions to CONFIRMED status` — Verifies state change and status code 200\n   - `confirms an already confirmed shipment and returns OK without changing status` — Verifies idempotence and retry behavior\n   - `rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with conflict error` — Verifies 409 response and correct error code\n   - `rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with not found error` — Verifies 404 response and correct error code\n\n**Unresolved Findings**\n\nNone. All acceptance criteria are met and verified by tests.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement: Add an idempotent POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint that transitions CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED, succeeds without change for already CONFIRMED shipments (idempotent), rejects CANCELLED shipments with 409 Conflict, and rejects non-existent shipments with 404 Not Found.\n\nChanged:\n- **ApiError.kt** — Added SHIPMENT_ALREADY_CANCELLED error code to support the 409 conflict case for cancelled shipments\n- **ShipmentController.kt** — Added confirm() endpoint implementing the state transition logic with proper error handling\n- **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added four test methods covering all four cases: successful confirmation, idempotent retry, cancelled rejection, and not-found rejection\n\nTests:\n- \"confirms a created shipment and transitions to CONFIRMED status\" — Verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED state change and persistence\n- \"confirms an already confirmed shipment and returns OK without changing status\" — Verifies idempotent behavior on retry\n- \"rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with conflict error\" — Verifies 409 status and SHIPMENT_ALREADY_CANCELLED error code\n- \"rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with not found error\" — Verifies 404 status and SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error code\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/; BUILD SUCCESS with 17 tests passing (5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests + 4 new confirm tests + 12 other unchanged tests), 0 failures, 0 errors.\n\nNot done: Nothing. All acceptance criteria satisfied."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3104,"cache_read_input_tokens":26050,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3104},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1eaeb16-f55f-4a53-a41e-21e9cc437fc4","uuid":"e0271a47-5052-41ca-be6a-94189da1cb96","timestamp":"2026-09-10T13:33:20.711Z","request_id":"req_011Ceuqu6bEqqzn7u38wshm8"}
